      "title": "About | APEC IIED",
      "description": "The APEC Institute of Innovation & Education Development (APEC IIED) is a project of Taipei Tech, under the direction of he Ministry of Education (MOE). It aims to accelerate Asia-Pacific regional education cooperation, strengthen partnerships with key international organizations, with a focus on human resource development in the digital age.",
